<h1>URBANIQ (v2.4 OPS) — Video Demonstration & Feature Guide</h1>
<p><strong>Municipal Heat Decision Support System (Pune City Operations)</strong><br>
<em>Target Audience: Hackathon Judges, Municipal Commissioners, Urban Planners, and Climate Decision Makers</em></p>

<div class="callout-box">
  <strong>Purpose of this Document:</strong> This document contains an exhaustive button-by-button, feature-by-feature guide for demonstrating your app in a video. It provides the exact screen actions, technical workflows, and word-for-word voiceover script for recording.
</div>

<h2>Table of Contents</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Executive App Summary & Value Proposition</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Complete Button & Interaction Catalog (Every UI Element Explained)</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Top Navigation & Header Controls</li>
      <li>Left Rail — Map Tools & Spatial Intervention Brushes</li>
