  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>On-Map Thermal Heat Scale Legend</strong></td>
    <td>Bottom-left docked visual color bar.</td>
    <td>Explains the 5 distinct temperature bands: Cool Green (&lt;33°C), Lime (34°C), Yellow (35.5°C), Orange (36.5°C), and Critical Hotspot Red (&gt;37.8°C).</td>
  </tr>
</table>

